  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Department of State - Peacekeeping Operations: South Sudan Security Sector Transformation (SST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support transformation of the Sudan Peoples Liberation Movement/Army (SPLA) to a professional, conventional force (through infrastructure support, equipment and training), in support of the Comprehensive Peace Agreement (CPA) in Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
